footprint on the planet.

01:03:29.490 --> 01:03:34.283
I'm intrigued by just balance
and doing what's right,

01:03:35.270 --> 01:03:37.840
but also I can't get
out of the cycle of like

01:03:37.840 --> 01:03:40.360
- Yeah.
- Craving hardcore dose

01:03:40.360 --> 01:03:41.810
of protein so.

01:03:41.810 --> 01:03:46.370
- Cravings are unreliable
narrators though at times.

01:03:46.370 --> 01:03:49.410
I mean there is undoubtedly a connection

01:03:49.410 --> 01:03:52.260
between the quality of your microbiome

01:03:52.260 --> 01:03:55.110
and the signals that are
being sent to your brain

01:03:55.110 --> 01:03:57.380
that get translated into cravings.

01:03:57.380 --> 01:04:00.060
So sometimes that craving is real,

01:04:00.060 --> 01:04:02.590
it's because your body
really does need something.

01:04:02.590 --> 01:04:05.590
Sometimes it's because your microbiome

01:04:05.590 --> 01:04:06.960
is saying this is what we like

01:04:06.960 --> 01:04:11.960
or it is just habit that gets triggered

01:04:12.370 --> 01:04:15.340
where you're uncomfortable
not setting it in that way.

01:04:15.340 --> 01:04:18.000
And I think to really
understand the difference

01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:23.000
you have to weather those
cravings for a period of time,

01:04:23.080 --> 01:04:25.330
whether it's 30 days
or something like that,

01:04:25.330 --> 01:04:27.510
to see how legitimate they really are.

01:04:27.510 --> 01:04:30.050
And only you know and
everybody's different.

01:04:30.050 --> 01:04:31.850
I'm the first person to say like,

01:04:31.850 --> 01:04:34.360
look I can only speak
from my own experience.

01:04:34.360 --> 01:04:36.740
I'm sharing from a place of

01:04:37.860 --> 01:04:39.720
personal experience only.
- Yeah, it worked for me.

01:04:39.720 --> 01:04:41.640
Yeah, it's great.
- Right, so.

