01:05:43.660 --> 01:05:45.960
So this book is sort of
intended to serve that,

01:05:45.960 --> 01:05:49.150
and my wife is incredible
cook they're all her recipes.

01:05:49.150 --> 01:05:50.950
And then we wrote another cookbook

01:05:50.950 --> 01:05:52.450
